   "doc": "A slash arc of reach {r} (tenths) about the executor (the chest pivot, S3: at the body + 1.2, rotated as the body): {yaw} / {pitch} offsets of the aim from the executor rotation, {roll} the blade plane about the aim (0 horizontal, +-35 diagonal, 90 vertical, 175 backhand: the sweep reversed). Four sweep frames (1 tick apart, the last one fading over 8 t), el 1 orange flame / el 3 white-gold with a crackle overlay; flame or spark particles at the arc's front.",
