   "doc": "An ember burst at the executor (T1 cape split, intro stance, death): 12 embers flung out and up, a warm glow, flame particles.",
   "cards": 14,
   "el_split": false,
   "ambient": false,
   "particles_only": false
  },
  "blink_out": {
   "args": [],
   "doc": "K vanish at the executor (the body + 1.2): a gold spark burst, a short flash, black feathers scattering (no blue: the player's blink is blue-white).",
   "cards": 14,
   "el_split": false,
   "ambient": false,
   "particles_only": false
  },
  "blink_in": {
   "args": [],
   "doc": "K reappear at the executor (the body + 1.2): gold sparks converge, a pop of light, feathers settle.",
   "cards": 10,
   "el_split": false,
   "ambient": false,
   "particles_only": false
  },
  "wing_flare": {
   "args": [],
   "doc": "The wings flare gold (B1 open, T1 flare): glints running out along both wing spans behind the executor (the body + 1.4, rotated as the body), a broad gold glow behind her, gold dust.",
   "cards": 9,
   "el_split": false,
   "ambient": false,
   "particles_only": false
  },
  "cocoon": {
   "args": [
    "pct"
   ],
   "doc": "The overload mantle cocoon over the hovering body (the executor = the body + 1.2; centre 1.1 b above it): the wrapped-wing shell (vertical billboard, 2.2 x 3.2 b), a warm glow, and cracks of light by {pct} (> 75 none, 51-75 dim, 26-50 bright, <= 25 white-hot). Long-lived (the cocoon pool, never counted against the fx cap); every call replaces the previous cocoon; cocoon_crack / fx/clear remove it.",
   "cards": 3,
   "el_split": false,
   "ambient": false,
   "particles_only": false
  },
  "cocoon_crack": {
   "args": [],
   "doc": "The mantle breaks: the cocoon pool is removed, the shell shatters into black feathers and light (a flash, a crack card bursting out, embers). At the executor (the body + 1.2).",
   "cards": 18,
   "el_split": false,
   "ambient": false,
   "particles_only": false
  },
  "nova_swell": {
   "args": [
    "t"
   ],
   "doc": "The nova tell (mantle_nova swell, 40 t): a white-gold glow and flare swelling over {t} ticks at the executor (the body + 1.2), gold motes drawn in from 4 b, rising sparks.",
   "cards": 10,
   "el_split": false,
   "ambient": false,
   "particles_only": false
  },
  "nova_flash": {
   "args": [],
   "doc": "The nova hit: an arena-wide white-gold flash at the executor (the body + 1.2): a huge glow, two shock rings racing out to 24 b at the floor, a flash, sparks.",
   "cards": 4,
   "el_split": false,
   "ambient": false,
   "particles_only": false
  },
  "ignite_blade": {
   "args": [],
   "doc": "Intro E10: the edge ignites. Executor = the sword guard, the blade straight up along +y for 2.2 b: five flame tongues climbing it in turn (vertical billboards, 14 t), embers and flame particles.",
   "cards": 9,
   "el_split": false,
   "ambient": false,
   "particles_only": false
  },
  "dust_ring": {
   "args": [
    "r"
   ],
   "doc": "Sand thrown up in a ring of radius {r} (tenths) about the executor (the floor point: landings, the intro drop, B3 bangs): eight dust puffs riding out to the radius, sand particles. Airborne (no floor card).",
   "cards": 8,
   "el_split": false,
   "ambient": false,
   "particles_only": false
  },
  "swap_fx": {
   "args": [
    "el"
   ],
   "doc": "G1 element swap at the executor (the body + 1.2, rotated as the body): to Pyro (el 1) flame tongues swirling up and embers, to Electro (el 3) gold arcs crackling around her and sparks; a glow in the new colour.",
   "cards": 11,
   "el_split": true,
   "ambient": false,
   "particles_only": false
  },
  "arrive_rift": {
   "args": [],
   "doc": "The arrival tear behind the player (PLAN §6.4): at the executor (the floor point 1.5 b behind the start, facing the arena) the dungeon rift's void, rim and four lightning arcs (S1's rlk:rift models when the pack has them, else the kit's fallback tear) shrink shut over 30 t, sparks and portal motes.",
   "cards": 6,
   "el_split": false,
   "ambient": false,
   "particles_only": false
  },
  "ambient_dust": {
   "args": [],
   "doc": "Arena ambience (the module, every ~10 t): sand motes falling through the warm haze and white ash around the executor (the arena centre), particles only; skipped while the fx cards are busy.",
